@startuml dataflow
!theme plain

title ELMOS Data Flow — Build Pipeline Architecture

' Storage and Input
database "Workspace\nConfig\n(elmos.yaml)" as WorkspaceConfig
database "Machine\nDefs\n(machines/)" as MachineDefs
database "Kernel\nSources" as KernelSrc
database "Toolchain\nCache" as ToolchainCache

' Processing stages
process "Config\nLoader" as ConfigLoad
process "Context\nBuilder" as ContextBuild
process "Fingerprint\nCalculator" as Fingerprint
process "DAG\nPlanner" as DAGPlanner
process "Kernel\nBuilder" as KernelBuild
process "Module\nBuilder" as ModuleBuild
process "Rootfs\nBuilder" as RootfsBuild
process "BSP\nIntegrator" as BSPIntegrate
process "Image\nAssembler" as ImageAssemble
process "QEMU\nBooter" as QEMUBoot

' Intermediate outputs
datastore "Build\nCache\n(.fingerprints)" as BuildCache
datastore "Build\nArtifacts" as BuildArtifacts
datastore "Plugin\nState" as PluginState

' Final outputs
database "Kernel\nImage\n(zImage)" as KernelImg
database "Kernel\nModules\n(.ko)" as KernelMods
database "Root\nFilesystem\n(initramfs)" as RootfsImg
database "Boot\nImage\n(combined)" as BootImg
database "QEMU\nDisk\nImage" as QEMUImg

' Input flows
WorkspaceConfig --> ConfigLoad : yml config
MachineDefs --> ConfigLoad : architecture defs
ConfigLoad --> ContextBuild : parsed config

KernelSrc --> Fingerprint : source hashes
ToolchainCache --> Fingerprint : toolchain version
ContextBuild --> Fingerprint : build parameters
Fingerprint --> BuildCache : current fingerprints
BuildCache --> DAGPlanner : cache hits/misses

ContextBuild --> DAGPlanner : context
DAGPlanner --> KernelBuild : tasks
DAGPlanner --> ModuleBuild : tasks
DAGPlanner --> RootfsBuild : tasks
DAGPlanner --> BSPIntegrate : tasks

' Build stage flows
KernelSrc --> KernelBuild : sources
ToolchainCache --> KernelBuild : cross-compiler
KernelBuild --> BuildArtifacts : logs
KernelBuild --> KernelImg : compiled image
KernelBuild --> Fingerprint : build artifacts

KernelImg --> ModuleBuild : module target
KernelSrc --> ModuleBuild : module sources
ModuleBuild --> BuildArtifacts : logs
ModuleBuild --> KernelMods : compiled modules
ModuleBuild --> Fingerprint : module hashes

MachineDefs --> RootfsBuild : rootfs packages
KernelMods --> RootfsBuild : modules to install
ToolchainCache --> RootfsBuild : sysroot
RootfsBuild --> BuildArtifacts : logs
RootfsBuild --> RootfsImg : filesystem image
RootfsBuild --> Fingerprint : rootfs hash

KernelImg --> BSPIntegrate : kernel
RootfsImg --> BSPIntegrate : rootfs
MachineDefs --> BSPIntegrate : board config
BSPIntegrate --> BootImg : bootable image
BSPIntegrate --> Fingerprint : final hash

KernelImg --> ImageAssemble : kernel
BootImg --> ImageAssemble : boot image
RootfsImg --> ImageAssemble : rootfs
ImageAssemble --> QEMUImg : disk image
ImageAssemble --> BuildArtifacts : metadata

QEMUImg --> QEMUBoot : disk image
BootImg --> QEMUBoot : boot image
ContextBuild --> QEMUBoot : qemu config
QEMUBoot --> BuildArtifacts : serial output
QEMUBoot --> PluginState : boot results

BuildCache --> PluginState : cache state
BuildArtifacts --> PluginState : build artifacts

note right of Fingerprint
  Cryptographic hashes ensure
  incremental builds are correct
end note

note right of DAGPlanner
  Directed Acyclic Graph ensures
  correct build order and
  enables parallel execution
end note

note bottom of QEMUBoot
  Emulation validates bootability
  before hardware deployment
end note

note bottom of PluginState
  Plugins hook into pipeline
  for custom functionality
end note
